# Buzzler Agency - Environment Variables

# 1. Lead Email Notifications (via Resend - https://resend.com)
# Free tier gives 3,000 emails/month (100/day).
# Set these in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Buzzler Leads <onboarding@resend.dev>
CONTACT_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=bubunbaral343@gmail.com

# 2. To send to hello@buzzleragency.com or any external address:
# Go to resend.com/domains -> Add buzzler.co.in -> add DNS records.
# Then change RESEND_FROM_EMAIL to: Buzzler Leads <leads@buzzler.co.in>
# And CONTACT_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL to: hello@buzzleragency.com

# 3. Optional: CRM / Database / Slack / Discord / Zapier Webhook
# Inquiries will also be dispatched as a structured JSON POST to this URL:
# LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://api.crm.com/v1/leads
